meeting on this island

569
00:22:22,833 --> 00:22:26,433
is a rare, beautiful stroke of luck.

570
00:22:26,433 --> 00:22:28,866
And I want to say this
even more to myself.

571
00:22:28,866 --> 00:22:29,933
Because by coming here,

572
00:22:32,266 --> 00:22:34,766
I stepped out of a layer of protection

573
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:39,000
that I never wanted to break
in my daily life.

574
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,733
And here, I found a version of myself

575
00:22:40,733 --> 00:22:44,166
that shines a little brighter.

576
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:45,500
I don't really know what else to say.

577
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,633
Standing here, I just feel

578
00:22:46,666 --> 00:22:48,533
incredibly lucky and happy.

579
00:22:48,533 --> 00:22:50,133
I hope every day from now on,

580
00:22:50,133 --> 00:22:51,800
all of you grow within happiness.

581
00:22:51,833 --> 00:22:52,333
Thank you.

582
00:22:59,933 --> 00:23:00,266
Beautiful.

583
00:23:03,700 --> 00:23:05,700
So perfectly written.

584
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:06,966
Every word hit the mark.

585
00:23:08,466 --> 00:23:08,766
My turn.

586
00:23:14,333 --> 00:23:15,533
Hello, Pan Xiaoyi.

587
00:23:15,533 --> 00:23:18,066
You said love is like building blocks.

588
00:23:18,100 --> 00:23:19,966
You stack one, I stack one.

589
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,533
But on the very first day on the island,

590
00:23:21,533 --> 00:23:23,166
you were already speed-running.

591
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,233
"No problem."

592
00:23:24,233 --> 00:23:25,366
"Got any tips?"

593
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:25,933
"Let's do it."

594
00:23:26,733 --> 00:23:27,733
Your catchphrase triple-combo

595
00:23:27,733 --> 00:23:29,866
spread across the island,

596
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:31,233
an epidemic named 'Pan Syndrome'.

597
00:23:32,300 --> 00:23:35,200
That's faster
than anyone could stack blocks.

598
00:23:35,233 --> 00:23:36,633
When asked for love strategies,

599
00:23:36,633 --> 00:23:38,566
you shrugged with pure sincerity,

600
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:39,866
"I really don't have any."

601
00:23:40,233 --> 00:23:41,166
And yet,

602
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:44,133
your Affection Points reached heights
like a tower piercing the clouds.

603
00:23:44,133 --> 00:23:46,166
But deep down,

604
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:47,933
you guarded only her.

605
00:23:49,100 --> 00:23:51,033
On the path toward the Moon of Affection,

606
00:23:51,066 --> 00:23:53,366
you built your devotion

607
00:23:55,533 --> 00:23:58,666
with rain-or-shine companionship,
night after night.

608
00:23:59,133 --> 00:24:01,266
That makes you the island's

609
00:24:01,300 --> 00:24:02,966
first official pick-up

610
00:24:02,966 --> 00:24:04,366
[Official Pick-up and Drop-off Service]
and drop-off service.

611
00:24:07,833 --> 00:24:09,300
When making every team-up choice,

612
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:11,800
your answers never changed.

613
00:24:11,833 --> 00:24:13,266
I pick Huihui.

614
00:24:14,300 --> 00:24:15,400
Huihui.

615
00:24:15,433 --> 00:24:17,166
Definitely Huihui.

616
00:24:20,733 --> 00:24:22,133
No matter where she stood,

617
00:24:22,133 --> 00:24:23,166
you always found her.

618
00:24:29,500 --> 00:24:30,966
Did you eat breakfast?

619
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:32,266
You wanna sit alone or with us?

620
00:24:32,266 --> 00:24:33,500
Not with you guys.

621
00:24:34,266 --> 00:24:35,500
I made the right choice.

622
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:36,200
Me too.

623
00:24:36,233 --> 00:24:37,300
Show me yours.

624
00:24:37,300 --> 00:24:38,366
Let's eat.

625
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:39,000
No appetite again?

626
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,200
So sleepy.

627
00:24:47,666 --> 00:24:49,133
You hate being called childish.

628
00:24:49,533 --> 00:24:50,266
True,

629
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:52,166
in this love trial,

630
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:53,866
you didn't act like a kid at all.

631
00:24:53,866 --> 00:24:55,266
Wherever you wanna go is not far away.

632
00:24:55,266 --> 00:24:56,133
I have flaws,

633
00:24:56,133 --> 00:24:57,000
but I can change them.

634
00:24:57,533 --> 00:24:59,400
Your affection wasn't built on tricks,

635
00:24:59,433 --> 00:25:01,633
only on your sincerity.

636
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:04,066
From a slightly lost newcomer

637
00:25:04,066 --> 00:25:05,900
to someone fiercely fixed on his goal.

638
00:25:08,466 --> 00:25:09,166
Come on, cheek heart.

639
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,533
Like this.

640
00:25:10,533 --> 00:25:11,200
Ugh,

641
00:25:11,233 --> 00:25:11,966
turn and smile.

642
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:12,833
Here you go.

643
00:25:12,833 --> 00:25:14,233
I'm eating my matcha flavor.

644
00:25:14,233 --> 00:25:15,166
Up.

645
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:15,533
Slowly.

646
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:19,600
[Awesome]
Your growth is awesome.

647
00:25:24,033 --> 00:25:25,033
Pan Xiaoyi,

648
00:25:25,033 --> 00:25:26,633
congratulations on receiving

649
00:25:26,633 --> 00:25:28,033
the 'One True 'Dan' Star' award.

650
00:25:29,266 --> 00:25:31,400
May this tower of your blocks

651
00:25:31,433 --> 00:25:32,866
[The Island's 'Dan' Star]
grow higher.

652
00:25:32,866 --> 00:25:34,533
[May a young heart stay loyal and bright.]
May the sea turn blue.

653
00:25:34,533 --> 00:25:35,833
May the sea turn blue.

654
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,800
All good things come to an end.

655
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:46,266
But there's one thing,

656
00:25:46,266 --> 00:25:47,366
we can meet again in the next chapter.

657
00:25:49,633 --> 00:25:52,266
I'll be looking forward to it.

658
00:25:52,266 --> 00:25:53,800
Maybe tomorrow,

659
00:25:53,833 --> 00:25:54,533
someday later,

660
00:25:54,533 --> 00:25:56,066
or years from now,

661
00:25:56,100 --> 00:25:58,133
I'll still be curious. Have you changed?

662
00:26:01,266 --> 00:26:04,133
Are you still smiling?

663
00:26:04,133 --> 00:26:04,866
That's all.

664
00:26:12,700 --> 00:26:13,533
Good one.

665
00:26:13,533 --> 00:26:14,800
Really well said.

666
00:26:14,833 --> 00:26:15,266
Right?

667
00:26:15,266 --> 00:26:15,766
Good.

668
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:17,900
Let me see your 'One True 'Dan' Star'.

669
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,200
Got any tips?

670
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:24,233
It's really the 'Dan' in my name.

671
00:26:28,866 --> 00:26:30,700
Tao!

672
00:26:35,066 --> 00:26:36,866
[Ugh]

673
00:26:36,866 --> 00:26:38,300
[Adjusting the Mic]

674
00:26:38,300 --> 00:26:39,433
He looks like a senior leader.

675
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,833
Hello, Guo Zhentao,

676
00:26:43,833 --> 00:26:45,133
August 2025,

677
00:26:45,133 --> 00:26:47,566
you first came to the Island of Affection.

678
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:49,000
And without meaning to,

679
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:51,066
you became the quietest islander of all.

680
00:26:53,333 --> 00:26:54,400
The number of people you talked to

681
00:26:54,433 --> 00:26:55,733
didn't even surpass
how many times you drank water.

682
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:00,866
Tactical hydration.

683
00:27:01,500 --> 00:27:04,366
On that day,
your sense of affection was lost.

684
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:06,600
On day two of this journey,

685
00:27:06,600 --> 00:27:07,800
her quirky, playful energy

686
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:09,066
quickly pulled you two closer.

687
00:27:09,700 --> 00:27:11,333
Right, Guo Zhentao?

688
00:27:11,333 --> 00:27:13,200
So annoying, stop calling me.

689
00:27:13,233 --> 00:27:14,133
Guo Zhentao.

690
00:27:15,900 --> 00:27:18,233
When the red moon rose,
and the sea breeze brushed past,

691
00:27:18,266 --> 00:27:19,933
you chose her for the date
without hesitation.

692
00:27:20,533 --> 00:27:21,466
Told you I'm an NPC.

693
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:22,300
You don't believe me.

694
00:27:22,300 --> 00:27:22,933
Somehow,

695
00:27:22,933 --> 00:27:24,566
that one photo frozen in your phone

696
00:27:24,600 --> 00:27:26,600
captured your
very first spark of interest.

697
00:27:26,600 --> 00:27:27,633
By day six of this journey,

698
00:27:27,633 --> 00:27:28,533
you started to talk

699
00:27:28,533 --> 00:27:30,400
more frequently than you drank water.

700
00:27:32,100 --> 00:27:34,400
On day eight's Love Training Camp,

701
00:27:34,433 --> 00:27:35,300
'kiss kiss', 'cuddle',

702
00:27:35,300 --> 00:27:36,833
'evil smirk' became instant classics.

703
00:27:36,866 --> 00:27:38,000
Cuddle.

704
00:27:38,033 --> 00:27:39,233
Bickering with her and teasing her

705
00:27:39,233 --> 00:27:41,500
all became your daily routine.

706
00:27:41,500 --> 00:27:42,000
Find yourself...

707
00:27:42,033 --> 00:27:43,500
So just looking for someone similar...

708
00:27:45,133 --> 00:27:46,433
My dad studies this stuff too.

709
00:27:46,466 --> 00:27:47,766
Don't tell me he's my boss.

710
00:27:47,800 --> 00:27:48,633
Fine, I'm not gonna win this afternoon.

711
00:27:48,633 --> 00:27:49,566
Nobody eats.

712
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:50,300
I quit.

713
00:27:53,100 --> 00:27:53,766
And just like that,

714
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:54,833
Tao exposed himself.

715
00:27:54,833 --> 00:27:56,133
He's actually a childish boy.

716
00:28:25,700 --> 00:28:26,933
Tao's crying.

717
00:28:26,933 --> 00:28:28,333
The macho guy's in tears.

718
00:28:28,333 --> 00:28:29,400
What happened, Tao?

719
00:28:29,433 --> 00:28:30,833
The macho guy's in tears.

720
00:28:43,266 --> 00:28:44,766
When affection gains direction,

721
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,666
everything else fades away.

722
00:28:54,866 --> 00:28:56,266
Tao.

723
00:28:56,266 --> 00:28:57,466
I knew he was gonna cry.

724
00:28:58,900 --> 00:29:00,533
What's wrong?

725
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:03,900
Come on.

726
00:29:04,700 --> 00:29:06,533
Why do they write these things?

727
00:29:06,533 --> 00:29:08,933
In situations like this,

728
00:29:08,933 --> 00:29:10,766
you need sunglasses. Seriously.

729
00:29:14,666 --> 00:29:15,600
You stayed unwavering.

730
00:29:15,633 --> 00:29:16,633
In the Affection Voting,

731
00:29:16,633 --> 00:29:17,700
you cast seven all-in votes.

732
00:29:17,866 --> 00:29:21,366
[Once the heart is sure,]

733
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:24,233
[it never holds back.]

734
00:29:24,233 --> 00:29:24,966
You also spent

735
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:27,133
all your survival points.

736
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,300
For you,

737
00:29:29,300 --> 00:29:31,233
choosing between love and bread
is never a problem.

738
00:29:31,266 --> 00:29:34,900
But on that silent night
when you kept pacing...

739
00:29:34,900 --> 00:29:36,433
They're still talking?

740
00:29:36,466 --> 00:29:37,566
Just rain already.

741
00:29:38,333 --> 00:29:39,833
You were unable to sit still,
walking back and forth.

742
00:29:39,866 --> 00:29:41,666
Your anxiety was loud and clear.

743
00:29:41,666 --> 00:29:42,600
You're wearing a little hat.

744
00:29:44,266 --> 00:29:45,866
Were you really thirsty?

745
00:29:45,866 --> 00:29:47,200
Or just overwhelmed
by a heart you couldn't settle?

746
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:51,033
You're not great with words,

747
00:29:51,066 --> 00:29:52,966
but your actions
spelled out your feelings.

748
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,500
The cold medicine
you handed over at dawn...

749
00:29:54,500 --> 00:29:55,700
Got you something good.

750
00:29:55,700 --> 00:29:58,200
That brown sugar drink
you made late at night.

751
00:29:58,233 --> 00:30:00,833
That Lunch delivered right to the bedside.

752
00:30:00,833 --> 00:30:02,266
Setting down your favorite milk

753
00:30:02,266 --> 00:30:03,700
just so she could have what she liked.

754
00:30:06,133 --> 00:30:07,033
And that little note.

755
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:10,633
Bold, brave.

756
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,100
Brave...

757
00:30:13,100 --> 00:30:14,200
Full of affection.

758
00:30:25,066 --> 00:30:25,966
Adorable.

759
00:30:27,466 --> 00:30:29,700
Truly, the most sentimental man
on the island.

760
00:30:38,466 --> 00:30:39,766
Congratulations on receiving

761
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,066
the 'One Small Star' award.

762
00:30:41,066 --> 00:30:42,766
[Island of Affection 'Small Star']
Maybe this Journey of Affection

763
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:44,100
[Island of Affection 'Small Star']
was just an unexpected detour

764
00:30:44,100 --> 00:30:45,300
[May each accident lead to a surprise.]
in the map of your life.

765
00:30:45,300 --> 00:30:46,166
[May each accident lead to a surprise.]
But may you continue

766
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:47,433
in your own private universe of love,

767
00:30:47,433 --> 00:30:48,466
clumsy yet burning,

768
00:30:48,466 --> 00:30:49,566
sincere yet unwavering.

769
00:30:55,866 --> 00:30:57,333
Poor 'old' me, getting all emotional.

770
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:02,066
As it said,

771
00:31:02,066 --> 00:31:03,100
I'm not great with words,

772
00:31:03,100 --> 00:31:04,400
not easy to open up,

773
00:31:04,433 --> 00:31:06,300
not easy to let people in.

774
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:07,833
He doesn't open up easily?

775
00:31:07,866 --> 00:31:09,600
He's already opened up 100%.

776
00:31:10,266 --> 00:31:10,933
Thank you.

777
00:31:16,333 --> 00:31:17,733
Seriously.

778
00:31:17,733 --> 00:31:18,833
I can't listen to this.

779
00:31:18,866 --> 00:31:19,366
I really can't.

780
00:31:22,100 --> 00:31:23,366
This is so embarrassing.

781
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,600
Your ears are bright red.

782
00:31:24,600 --> 00:31:25,533
Tao.

783
00:31:25,533 --> 00:31:26,000
Handsome.

784
00:31:29,333 --> 00:31:30,766
We recorded all of it.

785
00:31:31,700 --> 00:31:33,233
How am I supposed to
show my face at work now?

786
00:31:33,266 --> 00:31:34,566
I can't with this.

787
00:31:35,333 --> 00:31:36,433
You're done.

788
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:41,066
I seriously can't handle this.

789
00:31:41,066 --> 00:31:42,266
Your boss thinks you're too emotional.

790
00:31:42,266 --> 00:31:43,100
This job isn't for you.

791
00:31:43,100 --> 00:31:44,133
I can't go back after this.

792
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:48,400
This whole journey might've been

793
00:31:49,866 --> 00:31:51,933
a fast-track to growing up.

794
00:31:51,933 --> 00:31:54,933
Or maybe a process of opening up.

795
00:31:54,933 --> 00:31:56,766
Because to everyone,

796
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:58,866
my coworkers and friends especially,

797
00:31:58,866 --> 00:32:00,200
I come across as

798
00:32:00,233 --> 00:32:01,266
more mature

799
00:32:01,266 --> 00:32:03,933
and kind of serious.

800
00:32:05,300 --> 00:32:07,133
I don't really let my emotions

801
00:32:07,133 --> 00:32:08,333
spill out.

802
00:32:08,333 --> 00:32:09,733
I bottle them up and quietly

803
00:32:09,733 --> 00:32:10,933
deal with them on my own.

804
00:32:10,933 --> 00:32:13,833
This experience helped me
finally let everything out.

805
00:32:13,866 --> 00:32:16,266
It feels like it just keeps flowing,

806
00:32:16,266 --> 00:32:19,300
like a broken dam.

807
00:32:19,300 --> 00:32:20,566
The water doesn't stop.

808
00:32:21,266 --> 00:32:23,733
It's hard to dam it back up again.

809
00:32:23,733 --> 00:32:25,766
These ten-plus days

810
00:32:25,800 --> 00:32:27,466
feel like

811
00:32:27,466 --> 00:32:29,266
a flower

812
00:32:29,266 --> 00:32:31,166
opening up little by little.

813
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:33,033
It feels like

814
00:32:33,033 --> 00:32:33,833
it finally bloomed.

815
00:32:42,033 --> 00:32:43,533
Hi, Autumn.

816
00:32:43,533 --> 00:32:45,600
You said love is like co-op gaming.

817
00:32:45,633 --> 00:32:48,166
You level up together
to become better players.

818
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:50,833
So, did you find
your perfect co-op partner

819
00:32:50,833 --> 00:32:52,866
on this Island of Affection
life expansion pack?

820
00:32:55,633 --> 00:32:57,133
Day one, you clearly hadn't.

821
00:32:57,133 --> 00:32:59,400
Everyone else was talking about love,

822
00:32:59,433 --> 00:33:01,333
and you launched a solo survival mode.

823
00:33:04,500 --> 00:33:05,166
Day two,

824
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,900
you were committed

825
00:33:06,900 --> 00:33:07,833
to being an NPC.

826
00:33:07,866 --> 00:33:09,700
But quietly, in some hidden corner,

827
00:33:09,700 --> 00:33:12,366
someone had already seen you

828
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,700
as the brightest main character.

829
00:33:15,933 --> 00:33:16,933
Day three,

830
00:33:16,933 --> 00:33:18,833
you got hooked on the arena again.

831
00:33:18,866 --> 00:33:20,000
Yep.

832
00:33:21,733 --> 00:33:24,133
Focused only on winning, not love.

833
00:33:24,133 --> 00:33:25,233
Funny thing is,

834
00:33:25,266 --> 00:33:26,566
when you were losing on the court,

835
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:28,633
your love life quietly started winning.

836
00:33:28,633 --> 00:33:29,933
You got your very first date

837
00:33:29,933 --> 00:33:31,200
on the Island of Affection.

838
00:33:31,233 --> 00:33:33,033
When the camera shutter clicked,

839
00:33:33,033 --> 00:33:35,133
your awkward posing

840
00:33:35,133 --> 00:33:37,566
was a romance more genuine
than any promise.

841
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:40,033
It felt like you finally
switched on co-op mode

842
00:33:40,033 --> 00:33:41,700
and stepped onto
the main storyline of love.

843
00:33:44,266 --> 00:33:45,533
But teaming up

844
00:33:45,533 --> 00:33:47,633
is not something you take lightly.

845
00:33:47,666 --> 00:33:49,766
He kept sending you 'gear'.

846
00:33:49,800 --> 00:33:52,133
Cold meds.
