01:22:19,200 --> 01:22:21,533
and walking this journey together.

1922
01:22:21,533 --> 01:22:23,066
Now only one step remains.

1923
01:22:23,100 --> 01:22:24,500
Be bold,

1924
01:22:24,500 --> 01:22:25,766
let your feelings out,

1925
01:22:25,800 --> 01:22:27,600
and complete this story.

1926
01:22:27,600 --> 01:22:29,400
Please confirm your feelings.

1927
01:22:29,400 --> 01:22:30,333
If you're sure

1928
01:22:30,333 --> 01:22:32,533
they're the one,

1929
01:22:32,533 --> 01:22:33,866
[The Moonstone]
put your Moonstone into the box.

1930
01:22:33,900 --> 01:22:35,666
[that carries their feelings.]
put your Moonstone into the box.

1931
01:22:35,666 --> 01:22:37,566
Carry the box

1932
01:22:37,600 --> 01:22:39,133
to the Moon of Affection

1933
01:22:39,133 --> 01:22:40,666
and finish your confession.

1934
01:22:42,900 --> 01:22:45,566
[No Hesitation]

1935
01:22:46,033 --> 01:22:46,933
Got it.

1936
01:22:46,933 --> 01:22:49,466
[Heading out with the Moonstone.]

1937
01:22:50,733 --> 01:22:53,166
[Deep Breath]

1938
01:22:53,433 --> 01:22:55,266
Moonstone mission.

1939
01:22:55,266 --> 01:22:55,966
One stone.

1940
01:22:57,066 --> 01:22:58,966
At least we don't have to
read signs today.

1941
01:22:59,000 --> 01:22:59,833
Today feels good.

1942
01:23:00,900 --> 01:23:01,733
Really romantic.

1943
01:23:02,633 --> 01:23:03,766
I'm getting more nervous.

1944
01:23:03,800 --> 01:23:06,866
[Nervous,
Rambling Nonstop]

1945
01:23:18,866 --> 01:23:20,966
[Pan Xiaoyi has placed his Moonstone.]

1946
01:23:21,266 --> 01:23:22,166
It's in.

1947
01:23:23,666 --> 01:23:24,533
Dan.

1948
01:23:24,533 --> 01:23:26,600
[Reports Loudly to Dan]

1949
01:23:32,600 --> 01:23:35,066
[Nervous]

1950
01:23:35,866 --> 01:23:37,466
Can I pace a bit? I'm nervous.

1951
01:23:40,300 --> 01:23:42,566
I wasn't nervous before.
Now I'm shaking.

1952
01:23:44,000 --> 01:23:47,500
Huihui, please head to
the Moon of Affection.

1953
01:23:48,200 --> 01:23:50,133
Oh no, I'm nervous.

1954
01:23:50,866 --> 01:23:52,066
So nervous.

1955
01:23:56,200 --> 01:23:58,633
[More excitement in tomorrow's episode.]
Final confession moment.

1956
01:23:58,633 --> 01:23:59,866
[More excitement in tomorrow's episode.]
I really like you.

1957
01:23:59,866 --> 01:24:02,166
[More excitement in tomorrow's episode.]
Let's grow into better people together.

1958
01:24:02,200 --> 01:24:03,566
[More excitement in tomorrow's episode.]
I hope being with me

1959
01:24:03,566 --> 01:24:05,233
[More excitement in tomorrow's episode.]
makes you feel chosen.

1960
01:24:05,266 --> 01:24:08,800
My 'affection' is you,
the one who lights me up.

1961
01:24:08,833 --> 01:24:10,433
I really fell for you.

1962
01:24:10,900 --> 01:24:12,966
Look, I drew you a little heart.

1963
01:24:13,000 --> 01:24:14,433
My only wish

1964
01:24:14,433 --> 01:24:16,066
is to spend more time
getting to know you.

1965
01:24:16,066 --> 01:24:16,933
This is

1966
01:24:16,933 --> 01:24:19,066
the best ending we could hope for
on this island.

1967
01:24:19,100 --> 01:24:20,200
Let's hug.

1968
01:24:22,100 --> 01:24:23,700
Are you together?

1969
01:24:23,700 --> 01:24:26,433
The Island of Affection is closing soon.

1970
01:24:26,466 --> 01:24:27,900
I really don't want to leave.

1971
01:24:27,900 --> 01:24:30,333
We're filming one of those
bittersweet youth endings.

1972
01:24:30,333 --> 01:24:32,233
I hope everyone stays happy.

1973
01:24:32,266 --> 01:24:33,666
Goodbye, Shenzhen.

1974
01:24:33,666 --> 01:24:35,566
Wait for me in Beijing.

1975
01:24:35,600 --> 01:24:41,500
Goodbye, Island of Affection.
